      "message": "I think as per previous comment , it was said to move getUserHandles() part of mDeps\n\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/2954926/12/tests/unit/java/com/android/server/connectivity/SatelliteAccessControllerTest.kt#83\nIf you comment this line, does test fail?\nmakeMockUserManager returns mocked UserManager.\nBut this line does not use returned mocked UserManager.\nI think you wanted to do the following?\nval userManager \u003d makeMockUserManager(USER_INFO, USER_HANDLE)\ndoReturn(userManager).`when`(context).getSystemService(...)\nOr you can move mUserManager.getUserHandles to the dependencies.\nThough currently getUserHandles is not called since mHandler is mocked and mUserManager.getUserHandles is not called from this test.",
